erged_at":"2025-11-11T22:19:24Z"},"body":"Base PR for https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111679, https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111681, https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111682 and others.\r\n\r\nFixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/78805 (see https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107967#issuecomment-3220896106 )\r\n\r\nThis PR adds the option to add more advanced features to joypads in the future that require the `Input` code to call methods from `JoypadSDL` (or other drivers) without breaking encapsulation, basically dependency injection. Such methods include, for example, checking if a joypad has motion sensors, LED lights, enabling the motion sensors, changing LED light color, etc.\r\n\r\nThis PR also adds the HIDAPI joysticks support for Linux and macOS, as well as Windows sensors subsystem so that it can be used later for motion sensors and other features.\r\n\r\nThis PR is separated from the other 3 so that they can be reviewed independently from the motion sensors PR. Let me know if this is a good idea :D","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":